cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use ColabChem, please cite it as below, together with the
  methods it runs (see references and the README).
title: ColabChem
abstract: >-
  Google Colab notebooks for structure optimization, relaxed scans and
  transition state searches with the UMA machine learning potential, and
  DFT single point and ESP calculations with GPU4PySCF.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chiba
    given-names: Ryuhei
repository-code: "https://github.com/RChibaChiba/ColabChem"
url: "https://rchibachiba.github.io/ColabChem/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - computational chemistry
  - machine learning interatomic potential
  - UMA
  - transition state
  - DFT
  - Google Colab
